# Logging in to Island Hop with an email nobody has.
# Safe to run anywhere: an unknown email is refused before anything is written,
# and no real account gets a failed attempt (so none can be locked).

Test: A login with an unknown email is refused

  As visitor:
    go to login page
    type "nobody.humantest@example.com" in "Enter your email"
    type "Wrong-password-1" in "Enter your password"
    click "Sign In"
    should see "Invalid credentials"
    should still be on login page
